\fs14\
\fs28 This value can be a useful way of handling non-numeric data in an input file. It can also be a useful response to calculation errors. For more information on calculation errors, see the \b exceptionDuringOperation:error:leftOperand:rightOperand:\b0  method description in the NSDecimalNumberBehaviors protocol specification.\
